### Update player using Saga pattern
POST http://localhost:5010/api/saga/update-player
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player": {
    "idPlayer": 1,
    "name": "Michael",
    "surname": "Jordan",
    "fullName": "Michael Jordan",
    "birthday": "1963-02-17T00:00:00Z",
    "nationality": "USA",
    "position": "Shooting Guard",
    "physicalMetrics": [
      {
        "verticalJump": 120,
        "fatPercentage": 6,
        "benchPressWeight": 110,
        "squatWeight": 180,
        "sprintSpeed": 100,
        "weight": 88,
        "height": 198,
        "wingspan": 203,
        "dateOfMeasurement": "2024-01-15T00:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Get specific transaction by ID
GET http://localhost:5010/api/saga/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get all transactions
GET http://localhost:5010/api/saga/transactions

### Update player with different data (for testing)
POST http://localhost:5010/api/saga/update-player
Content-Type: application/json

